chunks.text:
[Intro]
{cold open: one low anvil strike, then a distorted synth bass pulsing in eighth notes}
{a deep male choir hums the signature: a dark 4-note descending minor motif, the hook of the whole track}
{a snare roll builds into the downbeat}

[Main theme]
{the full band hits on the downbeat: tight palm-muted metal guitars locked with war drums}
{the brass section states the 4-note signature motif loud and clear}
{the male choir shouts short wordless 'hey' accents on beat four; punchy, clear, tight low end}

[Main theme variation]
{the same motif harmonized in octaves by brass over double-time drums}
{metallic anvil hits on the backbeat; a short balalaika tremolo phrase answers between the brass statements}

[Break]
{the drums drop out: only the synth bass pulse, ticking metal percussion and the low choir holding a minor chord}
{cold and tense, a faint radio static texture; in the last two bars a big tom fill}

[Climax]
{everything returns at full intensity: the choir sings the motif fortissimo, brass and guitars in unison}
{driving kick drum, cymbal crashes on every phrase start}

[Ending]
{a last statement of the motif by brass and choir in half-time}
{then one full-band unison hit on the downbeat and a long natural ring-out of the choir and a low gong; a definitive ending, no fade-out}
